OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy start to the
OL,6,Fday but brighter spells developing
OL,7,Fwith some sunshine. The chance of a
OL,8,Ffew showers in the south in the
OL,9,Fafternoon, quite warm with gentle
OL,10,Fbreezes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FChance of a few showers in
OL,13,Fthe evening and becoming quite cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight, heavier showers likely for
OL,15,FAyrshire by dawn and these spreading
OL,16,Fnorth.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FCloudy with showers, heavy at
OL,19,Ftimes with some thunder possible, a
OL,20,Ffew bright spells at times too,
OL,21,Ffeeling cooler than Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
